WEBVTT

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:04.930
Universal Century 0096.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.050
Banagher Links,

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.050
a student attending
the Anaheim Electronics Industrial College

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.880
at the colony Industrial 7,

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:14.470
has a fateful encounter with
a green-eyed girl falling from the sky.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:16.880
Prevent it? Prevent what?

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:18.590
War.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.760
Banagher escorts the girl,
who says her name is Audrey Burne,

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:28.970
and after evading the pursuit
of the Neo Zeon group known as the Sleeves,

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:32.380
they arrive at the Vist mansion,
in Magallanica.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.550
I know this. I've seen that image before.

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:44.300
There they meet Cardeas Vist,
who is the chairman of Banagher's school.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:46.430
Banagher tries to stand up for Audrey,

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:48.760
but to his surprise she says
she doesn't need him,

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.340
and Banagher leaves disappointed.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:55.680
Meanwhile,
the Sleeves are approaching the mansion.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:01:00.380
If it's misused,
it could destroy the world.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:03.970
So you're going to give us
the key as a test, to start?

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:08.180
What is LaPlace's box, which has the power
to destabilize the Universal Century?

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:43.550
(THEY CALLED IT GUNDAM)

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:47.010
Get everyone out of here!

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:05.260
Get off my tail, damn it!

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:12.840
So heavy!

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:28.220
This'll shut you up!

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:45.930
Hurry!

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.550
There are holes in the colony.

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:09.510
The school's around there.

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:13.470
It's war. War has broken out.

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:15.470
War...

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:26.970
Audrey!

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.090
Wait, Banagher!

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:31.340
H-Hey!

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:53.550
Sir.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:57.590
It's a shame that a hundred year old
alliance can be broken so easily.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.880
The Federation is using this as an
opportunity to take it all away.

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:04.970
Of course, we were the ones
who tried to scrap it first.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:08.220
Gael, don't let the Federation have it!

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:54.720
We can't get out of here?!

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.550
Hey! Open up!

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:18.340
Hey, Banagher!

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:23.630
Micott? You're not hurt, are you?
What about the others-

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:24.630
Takuya!

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:46.090
Esther, Marco, Dennis,
Tom... Everyone!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.220
Micott...

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.430
Where'd everyone go?!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.430
Takuya, take care of Micott.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:56.510
What are you gonna do?

00:06:56.550 --> 00:06:57.760
There's someone I want to rescue.

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:58.720
Huh?

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:02.010
Do you recognize whose mobile
suit just ripped through here?

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:04.220
It looked like
a Zeta-type Transformable Suit...

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:05.380
I think it's from the Federation.

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:08.630
Then its mothership should be at
the Snail. Have them protect you.

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:17.090
Don't leave me here, Banagher!
I can't have you leave me!

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:19.260
Banagher!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.050
They appear to be special forces.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:36.130
The command module has probably...

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.760
In that case, we'll have to erase
the program ourselves.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.430
And then, the Unicorn...

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:45.800
Sir! Go on ahead!

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:27.590
Why would they do this?

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:38.470
Was it you, Alberto?

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:49.050
Don't shoot the kid.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.090
You can't get in touch with Marida?

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:04.680
Did Martha put you up to this?

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:08.840
You probably think
you've used the military,

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:10.800
but the ones being used here are...

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:22.470
Alberto...

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.430
Princess...

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:36.380
Marida.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:54.090
Hello, Audrey.

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:58.300
Haro!

00:09:58.340 --> 00:09:59.680
Banagher?

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.970
A civilian?! You can't come this way!

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:02.930
You...!

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:03.880
You know her?

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.220
N-No!

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.050
Incredible...

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:46.340
We're saved...
It's a Federation mobile suit.

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:50.430
It's an RGZ-95. A ReZEL, Micott.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:54.130
We're students at the
Industrial College.

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:57.720
They busted holes into the colony,
so we escaped. Please rescue us!

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:12.930
Audrey...

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:22.720
This...?

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.800
Gael? Are you all right?

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.430
You...?

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:59.510
Where is she... Where's Audrey?

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:04.510
She'd be alive. She's cheated death
on countless occasions.

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:06.880
You didn't leave her behind, did you?

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:09.880
Are you planning on escaping by
yourself in this mobile suit?

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.470
Even if I escape, I won't
survive for long.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:15.800
What the hell is your problem?!

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:19.510
You act all high and mighty and
yet you can't do anything!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:23.010
Audrey went to see you
in order to prevent a war.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.840
And you had the power
to do that, didn't you?!

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:30.380
People had plans for tomorrow...
for next week...

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:33.760
They weren't supposed
to die like this!

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:38.300
At least, my mother...
With my mom, it was different!

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.720
She had dignity...

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:43.340
Humans are different
from the animals.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:46.380
We're supposed to respect
the lives of others.

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:50.800
And yet, we adults have caused
pointless bloodshed.

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:53.510
Not only that, but we devoured
the Earth's resources

00:12:53.550 --> 00:12:56.050
and then sought
new ones in space.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:02.300
Humanity must control itself
and regain its dignity

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:06.130
in order to revive the hope that was
born a hundred years ago.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.510
Through the possibilities
that lay within,

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:12.300
we will demonstrate the power and
compassion of humanity.

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.930
Humanity alone possesses a God.

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:20.590
The power to transcend the now...
the inner God called "possibility".

00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:22.930
You've come this far;

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:25.840
are you confident that
those feelings of yours will not waver?

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:30.300
The burden she bears is immense.

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:33.380
You need the resolve to carry
the weight of the world on your shoulders

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:34.590
if you wish to go with her.

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:35.880
Do you still...?

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:42.010
I don't have confidence or resolve...
I just know I want her to need me.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:45.090
Very well. Take this and go.

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:06.590
Now, it will heed your words,
and yours alone.

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:09.720
If it judges you to be
a suitable pilot,

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:12.470
the Unicorn will grant
you powers unrivaled.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:15.010
It should then open the
way to Laplace's Box.

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:16.430
Laplace's Box?

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:21.760
A dark curse that has enslaved the
Vist Family for a hundred years.

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:26.380
But, if used the right way, it will bring
light to this Universal Century.

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:27.970
That being...?

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.550
Anna...

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:34.010
She didn't want this curse to bind you,
so she took you away from me...

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:38.510
She must hate me...
as must you as well.

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:40.180
But you must go forth!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:45.340
Fear not. If you trust in the possibilities
within and try with all your might,

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:47.380
the path will show itself to you!

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:50.510
No... it's too late for that.
It's selfish.

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:53.930
Please forgive me.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:59.630
I wanted to spend more...
much more...

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.510
Banagher...

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:13.260
My wish has finally
come true, Anna...

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:16.260
Father!

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:28.090
Father...? Did I... just now...

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:31.130
My own...

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:00.970
To my only desire...
The beast of possibility...

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:05.380
The symbol of hope... Father...

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:12.090
I'm sorry, Mom. I must...

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:21.720
...go!

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:42.340
Audrey.

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:45.680
Banagher?

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:46.800
Princess?

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:58.470
Funnels!

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:08.050
Wha-?!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:16.760
Get... Get the hell out of here!

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:40.760
I can shoot it down!

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:48.590
Wha-?!

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:29.550
Gundam...

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:50.430
Gundam...

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:13.560
That thing is built with psycho-frame
throughout the body?

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:19.640
No doubt about it. The unidentified
single-horned suit transformed...

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.180
...no, morphed!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.180
That's a Gundam!

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:24.140
Gundam...

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.720
It really... It really is a Gundam.

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:28.060
Gundam?

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:31.060
The first mobile suit
developed by the Federation.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.560
Zeon called it the White Devil.

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:35.310
Bridge!

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:37.890
The machine
that's engaging the Sleeves' quad-wing

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:40.260
definitely looks like a Gundam type!

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:41.680
Seriously, a Gundam?!

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:47.140
Gundam...

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:48.930
Gundam... is the enemy!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:41.220
Attention unidentified machine,
reply if you can hear me!

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:45.970
Please identify your affiliation
and your combat objective.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.100
I repeat...

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:50.760
A wretched fiasco, Suberoa Zinnerman.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:53.260
You were neither able to
obtain Laplace's Box,

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:55.810
nor rescue the princess.

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:58.140
None of these developments
could have been foreseen.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:02.850
For now, we have no choice but to
wait to hear from the princess.

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:04.810
Meaning you want us to sit around
and do nothing?!

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:06.180
Lieutenant Angelo...

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:11.350
I hear the enemy that drove off
Marida was a Gundam.

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:13.260
Intriguing.

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:15.510
I might just need to go out there myself.

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:18.640
Have the Garencieres find out
the Federation ship's next move.

00:21:18.680 --> 00:21:19.680
Yes sir.

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:23.970
I will rectify this fiasco
even if it costs me my life.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:26.510
Don't let past mistakes weigh you down.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.510
Just learn from them and move on.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:31.720
That's the privilege of being an adult.

00:22:01.430 --> 00:22:02.390
Mom...

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:41.640
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.680 --> 00:23:44.060
FULL FRONTAL'S PURSUIT,

00:23:45.140 --> 00:23:48.470
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
